.eto/img/2014/04/06/9599353/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おちゃめなまひろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上品にお食事中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/04/06/9599353/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お蕎麦をお召し上がりのななみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背中に乗ってきたゆったん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/04/06/9599353/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このまま五分経過"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/04/06/9599353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/04/06/9599353/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋はわちゃわちゃしていて\n楽しい瞬間がたくさんなのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ恒例にしようかな！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二日目\n・個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服は1部〜4部まで\n全ての部で違う服を着ました！\nオール変えたというわけでは\nないんだけど、ちょこちょこ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しく 私服を撮影する時間が\n全く無かったんです...\n楽しみにしていた方が居たら\nごめんね〜（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから後日またUPします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に言うと\n・1部\nNOGIBINGO!2の萌えキュン企画で\n着てた洋服の上下"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・2部\nみさみさーくる常連さんは\n知っているかも？\n今年一番 みさがお気に入りの\nmilkスウェット(´｡•o•｡`)♡\n下は 1部と同じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・3部\n1部の服に黒のジャケット羽織る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・4部\n紫のシフォンレーストップスに\n白のデニムスカート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしてこんなに\n服を変えれたかというと...\nボブだから髪のヘアチェンジが\nあんまり無いから少し余裕がある"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと今日たくさんのメンバーが\nコスプレをしていましたね〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャイナ三姉妹に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/04/06/9599353/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔女の宅急便のキキに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/04/06/9599353/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初音ミクちゃんコンビも！\n(写真撮れなかった〜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでファンの方から\nみさみさもコスプレしてよ！\n隣のレーン可愛いよ！って\nかなりかなりかなりかなり\nたくさんの声をいただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっか。\nそんなに君たちコスプレが好きか！\nそうなのか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それなら期待に応えようではないか！\nということで。\n今回のシングル個別の中の\nどこかでしようと思います☆笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそんなに\n大好きなアニメないからな〜..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NARUTOと\n進撃の巨人くらいしか\n見たことないからな〜...\n巨人のコスプレするわけにも\nいかないしさ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コスプレなにが